{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "658d5a095dfa01e56b8c0c44849dfcc2453cf723e59960da875f0c2c64d546e3", "ja": "これまでとこれから", "zh": "过往与未来", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "71f09716dd50166f216941879967caaa0a0dc8f693a198080a7ed38718a92763", "ja": "ツアーのレッスンが開始！　様子を見に来た\nプロデューサーは、アイドル達と感謝を伝え\n合い絆を深める。一方、武道館へタスキを繋\nげるというのは、具体的に何をすべきかと悩\nむ一同。余裕がある時に考えてみることに。", "zh": "巡演的课程开始了！前来查看情况的\n制作人与偶像们互相表达感谢，进一步\n加深了羁绊。另一方面，大家烦恼着究竟\n该具体做些什么，才能将接力带传到武道馆。\n决定等有空的时候再想想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bb4c89c5a33840879ed3721a781b2063377fa8881048e8f5223158e573e4c0cf", "ja": "（ツアー公演のレッスン開始！　全員のスケジュール\nはなかなか合わないが、どうにか進めてもらっている）", "zh": "（巡演公演的练习开始了！虽然大家的日程很难协调，但总算在设法推进了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1001_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "bea59d402e39d7007b16460a70af6ec03760f9c735998ef0a94e08685b87f655", "ja": "あっ、おやぶんだ！　お疲れさま～！\nレッスン見にきてくれたの？　くふふ♪", "zh": "啊，是大将！辛苦啦～！\n你是来看我们练习的吗？咕呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b14168f388fc093017549b56e4621dd61ba9a015ebd97e7368e7d70db4d9c0b7", "ja": "ああ、お疲れさま。\nみんな、どんな様子かと思って。", "zh": "啊，辛苦了。\n我就是想来看看大家的状态。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "624858eb7c083769100d078d414088f01dbccb04b83b77013f219c4d5e86fe56", "ja": "あんたもヒマね～。わざわざ来なくたって、\nこの伊織ちゃんがいるんだから、心配ないのに。", "zh": "你也很闲呢～。就算不特地跑一趟，\n有我伊织在，根本就不用担心嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bcecad2d3726a6e2531ca54c4d57f89ff9f039821b8c246aa2b203132a667e22", "ja": "ダンスレッスン、順調ですよ～♪\n真さんが、すっごくスパルタですけど……。", "zh": "舞蹈训练进展顺利哦～♪\n虽然真实在是太严格了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "859f1c627f940d1fde677bed1e137efc5bbab0d5c2a619de3ca0e6b8f538e73a", "ja": "ええっ！？　普通にやってるだけなんだけどなぁ……。\nとりあえず、ちょっと休憩にしようか。", "zh": "诶！？我只是正常练习而已啊……\n总之，先稍微休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "3e23ca983a7243370ea62f9f1a7fa30d2825adf14578ec847224d6e1ee37f4b0", "ja": "わーい♪　ねえねえおやぶん、たまきたち、\n武道館に行くんだよね？　くふふ、楽しみ～♪", "zh": "好耶～♪　我说老大老大，环她们\n是要去武道馆对吧？　嘻嘻，好期待呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "96b35e5a3309b0d0f265bb244b6f97969d263236816a01c751e18e4fc29db1d2", "ja": "まあ、先にツアーだけどな。\n楽しみにしてくれているのは、なによりだよ。", "zh": "不过，接下来要先进行巡演就是了。\n你能期待这次活动，我比什么都高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1fa2a8662a533a708ac935cfda695511e4f844e5a32ba0ee16ce09b7a4fb2992", "ja": "わたしも楽しみ～♪　でも、武道館ってだけで、\nどうしてこんなにドキドキするのかな……？", "zh": "我也很期待～♪不过，只是想到要在武道馆演出，为什么就这么紧张呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "67abeff8fd2ce6f4f47989507515d1f25fd5a53aca3238c8e16410c7e978d955", "ja": "ハコはそれほど大きくないんだけど……\nやっぱり、特別な感じはするよね。", "zh": "场馆不算特别大，不过……\n果然还是会让人觉得很特别呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "96edf38559952be5c39c4b0d7095213da997f0fbac0346c125f41a0757b561f2", "ja": "春香と千早も、同じようなことを言っていたわね。\n武道館って、海外のアーティストもよく使うし……。", "zh": "春香和千早也说过类似的话呢。\n武道馆经常被海外艺术家使用，而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "bfea550760b41e7d906a86abed4eed978a9eeb9c3e7355b1ee816181b9a8690e", "ja": "そうだな。思い入れの強い場所なんだと思う。\nそれは、ファンの人達にとっても同じかもしれないな。", "zh": "是啊。我想那是个承载着深厚感情的地方。\n对粉丝们来说，或许也是一样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e1ed6a6411eb36614b77989d5b301a7fce72e7df072cf9add575dacf8fdcc498", "ja": "みんな、よろこんでくれるといいな～。\n武道館もツアーも、最高の思い出にしちゃいますよ～♪", "zh": "大家要是都能开心就好了～  \n武道馆和巡演，我都会把它们变成最棒的回忆哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "5dc37a27390c8ac76fdaf7e4435f9b0c38c26f77633322c9df9c9e4e8eba1aa9", "ja": "くふふ……楽しみ～♪　ねえねえおやぶん、\nたまきのこと、公園で見つけてくれてありがとー！", "zh": "咕呼呼……好期待啊～♪ 对了对了，老大，谢谢你在公园发现了环——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "1aa7ff164ca12e2706698ee91e12a66ebafc231abcc3d7f735c963faf514ca28", "ja": "おやぶんが誘ってくれたから、\nたまき、今すっごくアイドル楽しいぞ～！", "zh": "因为老大邀请了我，环，环现在觉得当偶像超开心的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1016_p", "source_sha256": "99c20791016797d35ad03ca8ce3b8988c505db9ac152eb3537c2b238c5900b39", "ja": "こちらこそ！\n765プロのアイドルになってくれてありがとう。", "zh": "我才要谢谢你！  \n谢谢你成为765 Pro的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7f76beb1c180d0e2d28cba2061c713fca584e457910df04712fab5fb32e442fe", "ja": "もちろん、環だけじゃなく、他のみんなもだ。", "zh": "当然，不仅是环，其他所有人也是一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "5b6fb5433fce51f6d0f77317d25b35d973d8445221b788ade16321800863a571", "ja": "あんたにしては、殊勝なこと言うじゃない。まあ、\n伊織ちゃんがアイドルになったのは当然としても……。", "zh": "难得你会说出这么像样的话嘛。也罢，  \n伊织成为偶像本来就是理所当然的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "660f20f9429734874fa7485d6a3c5a094cfc36dfa1aee5bc09c9e42eb8d24dc5", "ja": "私をプロデュースするって決めたことには、\n感謝してあげてもいいわよ？　にひひっ♪", "zh": "对于你决定制作我这件事，我也可以表示感谢哦？　嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "5249c6de7eef121e38911350dde4e22e0126e7af8842a3db91ed2e58e2d23bec", "ja": "ボクも感謝してますよ！　……よーしっ、それじゃ\n休憩終わり！　レッスンの続き、ガンガンいくぞーっ！", "zh": "我也很感谢你哦！……好——！那么，休息结束！继续训练，全力上吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ccf426dbc8eef503e2958c179c36de47a148c9c43003b8501b9cf836706cf49d", "ja": "はーい！　真さん、今度は\n優し～く、教えてくださいね～？", "zh": "好——！真前辈，这次请温柔地教我哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1024_021mat", "source_sha256": "f3839149c83d6e1a2f7e26e89655a78f596d52e1836bdb2b70c26ed99a5c0626", "ja": "はい、ほー！　はい、ほー！　はい、ほー！\nみんな～！　もうワンセット、いけそうなのです？", "zh": "好——！好——！好——！\n大家～！再来一组，没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "492b09a7ed44b67fe5a877fa669bc5770eff89debaf7bcd86ddd686a6622fbbc", "ja": "はい、ほー！　はい、ほー！\n大丈夫です、まつりさん！　いけます！", "zh": "嗨哟——！嗨哟——！\n没问题，まつり小姐！还能继续！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1026_037nao", "source_sha256": "2175c04182a6b7d5de2b2d005768ae2db7087758f5354f55750b3bed9203bb93", "ja": "私もいけるで！　はい、ほー！\n基礎体力作りは、演劇の時も散々やったもんな♪", "zh": "我也行啊！嘿——哟！基础体能训练，以前演戏的时候也没少做嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1027_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7a08c5f7d679d4d1d351b3e1fb7e89cddb8dc17e607dd18f1b927acc162dc862", "ja": "ふぅ、はぁ……ふぅ。\nみんな、すっごく頼もしくなったね……はぁ、はぁ。", "zh": "呼……哈……呼。\n大家都变得特别可靠了呢……哈啊，哈啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1028_021mat", "source_sha256": "beb32947b68be78f897341d731553c77473d0e11ee2d9af9e3d7d5ddb4021345", "ja": "ほ？　雪歩ちゃん、無理は禁物なのです。\nまだまだ先は長いのです。休憩にしましょー！", "zh": "咦？雪步，千万不能勉强自己哦。\n前面的路还长着呢。我们休息一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1029_004yuk", "source_sha256": "513a2b59cb36cbfb86ab7630b5c2e4cfb5295182b77b6dcda990fd696ccff20c", "ja": "う、ううん、大丈夫！\n私ももうちょっと、みんなと一緒に……。", "zh": "不，不用担心，我没事！\n我也想再和大家一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1030_p", "source_sha256": "b93add1c0c88e873ca76165c96e81d670fcae6e1b6f486683fbefe51c15ca4a2", "ja": "おーい、みんな～！　お疲れさま。\n飲み物の差し入れ、持って来たぞ！", "zh": "喂——大家～！辛苦了。\n我带了饮料来慰劳大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1031_021mat", "source_sha256": "f5d23405fa9867ce627984e101e1b370b1c16395690e153ab644e9414734ab2a", "ja": "ほ？　{$P$}さん！\nナイスタイミングなのです♪　さすがなのです。", "zh": "哦？{$P$}先生！  \n来得正是时候♪ 真不愧是你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1032_037nao", "source_sha256": "bf2fa913c71efef5eca46f0a760fb35db86b703b70d42927f8d5218af3890d16", "ja": "ありがとうございます～！　ふぅ……考えてみると、\nオーバーワーク気味やったかもなぁ。星梨花、休もか！", "zh": "谢谢啦～！呼……仔细想想，我可能有点太拼了。星梨花，我们休息一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "2d739b3c0fecd20d6cd373f0e1b573ec20f2626ff550835f88eca50e4b4f279b", "ja": "はい、奈緒さん！\nひと休みしてから、また頑張りましょう♪", "zh": "好的，奈绪小姐！\n休息一会儿后，我们再继续努力吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1034_p", "source_sha256": "71624921971ee148f2a577677771d70ec533786e98f96c6134f65b946bd2a856", "ja": "みんなも気合いが入っているみたいだな。\nやっぱり、後に武道館が控えているからか？", "zh": "大家看起来也都干劲十足啊。\n果然是因为后面还有武道馆在等着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1035_021mat", "source_sha256": "4a28f006f60405e7aee4b1d6c320b11857149d7c2beaee027f91e0a4fb367da2", "ja": "もちろん、それもあるのです！　でも姫は、\nファンのみんなに、おかえりと言って欲しいのです♪", "zh": "当然也有这个原因！不过，人家更希望粉丝们对我说“欢迎回来”♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1036_037nao", "source_sha256": "b3a58b6966a75cb81275cc6dde789a36ddbda5295cc9314cece4c272b76b8d4f", "ja": "せやな♪　ツアーめっちゃがんばったし、\n磨き抜かれた私の表現力、早よ見てほしいわ～。", "zh": "是啊♪巡演时我可是拼尽全力了，也想让大家早点看看我这磨炼出来的表现力～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1037_004yuk", "source_sha256": "854b1ec0939baafcd7ebc9949e7dd973882db6f83896bd9a73d5ad74cbad04c1", "ja": "私も、表現力は磨かれた気がするなぁ。明るい\n失恋ソングを歌うのに、色々と考えたから……ふふ。", "zh": "我也觉得自己的表现力好像有所提升了。为了唱好明快的失恋歌曲，我思考了很多……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1038_p", "source_sha256": "1c09f81c833057e1a816167499bc12ba9150ea77dded4a3cf3e8176f72fc2db8", "ja": "うん、首都圏への凱旋も大切なテーマだから。\nそういう気持ちでいてくれるとありがたいよ。", "zh": "嗯，凯旋回首都圈也是个重要的主题。\n你能抱着这种心态，我就很欣慰了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1039_022ser", "source_sha256": "857f0bdf20a0d7bcf9f5b017da8681689ce5096f5fc038470f2f9d68535ae8ad", "ja": "えへへ♪　あ、{$P$}さん。\nわたし、それでひとつ不思議なんですけど……。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪　啊，{$P$}先生。\n我有一件事觉得很不可思议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1040_022ser", "source_sha256": "1ab035ce528ea748bae86f296767daeb7c64b2fc8f9712dc22eb85da4e58820f", "ja": "武道館へのタスキをつなぐ、って言いましたよね？\nそれって、何をしたらいいんでしょう？", "zh": "你说过要把接力带传到武道馆，对吧？\n那具体要怎么做才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1041_p", "source_sha256": "996f2900d9f695150a8bef7e4d63de1d3ae1fd4bf9322dcbdee0a81eb10fe423", "ja": "何をって……具体的に、って話だよな？\nうーん、それは……。", "zh": "你问具体要做什么……是这个意思吧？\n嗯，这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1042_p", "source_sha256": "558db644bcd91be485cc561a8584c62c18acad9ad43c5ae21fcf1ffef3a4bc65", "ja": "まあ普通に考えれば、4つの公演を、\n続けて成功させていく……ってことなんだろうけど。", "zh": "不过按常理来想，应该就是让这4场演出\n接连取得成功……这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1043_037nao", "source_sha256": "f4c7c7d99e74fec40f58804993f5d5d626693350e248c36178387e3a6222e719", "ja": "それでいいんですかね？\nなんや、普通過ぎる気ぃしますけど……。", "zh": "这样就行吗？\n总觉得有点太普通了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1044_021mat", "source_sha256": "29f31d692836cdcbd78ae7720cb0fc28ce3b8282562ac574a904cfb5b8b57d4c", "ja": "なにか、わんだほー！なアイディアがあれば、\n楽しくなりそうですけど……むむむ。", "zh": "要是能有什么超棒的点子，应该会变得更有趣吧……唔唔唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1045_004yuk", "source_sha256": "fa88ef621918f8216e05217f2952404d1727324d7b11e08aa6e1f276a6313dc7", "ja": "でも、今はレッスン始まったばかりだし、\nみんないっぱいいっぱいかも。", "zh": "不过，现在才刚开始训练，大家可能都已经忙不过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1046_037nao", "source_sha256": "cc8496f8b2f73f729c2cc76f4be0a8e77569390c6cfa583125980a3d288f9e07", "ja": "ほんなら余裕ができた時にでも、みんなで考えよか？\n今はとりあえず、走り込みや～！", "zh": "那等大家有空闲的时候，再一起想想吧？\n现在先去跑步训练啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1047_p", "source_sha256": "c96912cb4017bff7dc98e97683843ecd69442e649abd3dca9dbf74eec2b25231", "ja": "（ただ公演を繋げていくだけではない何か……\n確かに、やりようがあるかもしれない）", "zh": "（不仅仅是把一场场公演衔接起来……\n确实，或许还有办法可想）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_02_1048_p", "source_sha256": "b32d6f6840c82a1a23cb247dbe3aa990cde7d09a85989e74af4153ef2a7d8d6d", "ja": "（自分達で疑問を持ち、行動しようとする……\nみんな、本当に頼もしくなったな！）", "zh": "（会自己产生疑问，并试着付诸行动……大家真的变得越来越可靠了啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
